      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PROD vs UAT: each service runs on its own dedicated vServer (api · sso · frontend · ads); cache is a managed MemStore and Postgres a managed vDB (no co-located containers); own VPC 10.101.0.0/16 and public host leocdp.com. Ops is hardened — pgAdmin and Netdata are Keycloak-SSO-gated via oauth2-proxy (only Portainer stays direct). Deploys pull the pinned vX.Y.Z release image. Backend (Dagster) and tracking boxes are drawn dashed — designed in the overlays but not yet provisioned.",
      "originalText": "PROD vs UAT: each service runs on its own dedicated vServer (api · sso · frontend · ads); cache is a managed MemStore and Postgres a managed vDB (no co-located containers); own VPC 10.101.0.0/16 and public host leocdp.com. Ops is hardened — pgAdmin and Netdata are Keycloak-SSO-gated via oauth2-proxy (only Portainer stays direct). Deploys pull the pinned vX.Y.Z release image. Backend (Dagster) and tracking boxes are drawn dashed — designed in the overlays but not yet provisioned.",
      "fontSize": 11.5,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
