      "text": "L4 Network Load Balancer  (customer360-nlb-prod · NLB_Small)\nleocdp.com  →  <prod LB public IP>   ·   TCP passthrough (no TLS)\n:443 / :80 → Caddy      :3000 → Dagster (planned)\n:9443 → Portainer (direct TLS)   :19999 → Netdata (SSO)   :5050 → pgAdmin (SSO)",
